# Scenario 'settings_phone': the HIDDEN fifth entry of モバイルせってい, 電話番号の変更 (change telephone number). It appears when B+SELECT+RIGHT
# are held while the entry モバイルせってい is chosen on the title screen (68:4F9E: `ldh a,[hJoyHeld] ; and $16 ; cp $16` right after the joypad
# poll; hJoyHeld uses the rP1 layout: A=1 B=2 SELECT=4 START=8 RIGHT=$10 LEFT=$20 UP=$40 DOWN=$80). Flows (each after a power cycle, `reset`):
#   1. 電話番号を変更する, place 1, 自動で入力する (automatic number), confirmations
#   2. 電話番号を変更する, place 2, 手動で入力する (manual): explanation, Internet number keypad (digits 1 2 5), pager number keypad, comment
#      keyboard, confirmation, "つづけて登録しますか?"
#   3. 通常使う電話番号を選択する (choose the number normally used): place choice, confirmations
# Starts from the state left by 'tutorial_profile'. Screen names = my reading of the screenshots.
# --- flow auto
reset
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A                        # title -> menu
waitstable 60 max 600
tap DOWN
wait 30
taplen 30
tap A+B+SELECT+RIGHT         # モバイルせってい with the hidden combination held
taplen 4
waitstable 60 max 600
shot auto_menu
tap DOWN x4
wait 30
shot auto_menu_5th
tap A                        # 電話番号の変更
waitstable 60 max 600
shot auto_choose
tap A                        # 電話番号を変更する
waitstable 60 max 600
shot auto_place
tap A                        # place 1
waitstable 60 max 600
shot auto_method
tap A                        # 自動で入力する
waitstable 60 max 900
shot auto_confirm
tap A                        # はい
waitstable 60 max 600
shot auto_register
tap A                        # はい
waitstable 60 max 900
shot auto_done
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot auto_after
# --- flow manual
reset
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A                        # title -> menu
waitstable 60 max 600
tap DOWN
wait 30
taplen 30
tap A+B+SELECT+RIGHT         # モバイルせってい with the hidden combination held
taplen 4
waitstable 60 max 600
shot manual_menu
tap DOWN x4
wait 30
shot manual_menu_5th
tap A                        # 電話番号の変更
waitstable 60 max 600
shot manual_choose
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap RIGHT
wait 40
tap A                        # place 2
waitstable 60 max 600
tap DOWN
wait 40
tap A                        # 手動で入力する
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # explanation
waitstable 60 max 600
shot manual_keypad_1
tap A
tap RIGHT
tap A
tap DOWN
tap A
tap START
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot manual_keypad_2
tap A
tap DOWN
tap RIGHT
tap A
tap START
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot manual_comment_intro
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot manual_comment_kb
tap A x2
tap START
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot manual_confirm
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot manual_register
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot manual_done
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot manual_after
# --- flow select
reset
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A                        # title -> menu
waitstable 60 max 600
tap DOWN
wait 30
taplen 30
tap A+B+SELECT+RIGHT         # モバイルせってい with the hidden combination held
taplen 4
waitstable 60 max 600
shot select_menu
tap DOWN x4
wait 30
shot select_menu_5th
tap A                        # 電話番号の変更
waitstable 60 max 600
shot select_choose
tap DOWN
wait 40
tap A                        # 通常使う電話番号を選択する
waitstable 60 max 600
shot select_place
tap RIGHT
wait 40
tap A                        # place 2
waitstable 60 max 600
shot select_confirm
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot select_2
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot select_3
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot select_4
tap B
waitstable 60 max 600
shot select_back
